		"Name": "Mushu",
		"Details": "The Mushu holds a place of distinction: it is one of the very rare chassis to be built with a compact engine and a unique compact gyro as standard equipment. Additionally, the Mushu is the first home-grown design of the Aurigan Reach and was put into production shortly before their disastrous civil war. The Mushu MHU-4T is the product of the Treaty of Micross, built around a Sanctuary Dense Engine, and features a centerline Superheavy Lance as its main and only armnament. An Exchanger, Heat Bank, and Six Coolant Pods struggle in vain to keep the mech cool.  \n\n <b><color=#e51717>COMMUNITY CONTENT</color></b>",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_mushu"
	},
